              "value": "Necrotic Decay"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy, negative)\n\nWhen Vischari dies, her invisible flesh rots away and sublimates into a foul-smelling gas that fills a 5-foot emanation around her body. This gas deals 7d6 negative damage to creatures in this area as their flesh curdles and rots (24 basic Fortitude save)."
